SimulationType                MonteCarlo
NumberOfCycles                1000
NumberOfInitializationCycles  500
PrintEvery                    100

Forcefield                    local
ChargeMethod                  Ewald
EwaldPrecision                1e-6
CutOffVDW                     12.8
CutOffCoulomb                 12.8
RemoveAtomNumberCodeFromLabel yes

ComputeEnergyHistogram        yes
WriteEnergyHistogram          yes
ComputeNumberOfMoleculesHistogram yes
WriteNumberOfMoleculesHistogram   yes

Framework 0
FrameworkName framework
UnitCells 2 2 1
HeliumVoidFraction 0.29
ExternalTemperature 273.15
ExternalPressure 1e4 5e4 1e5 5e5 1e6

Component 0 MoleculeName pentane
            MoleculeDefinition local
            TranslationProbability 0.5
            RotationProbability 0.5
            ReinsertionProbability 0.5
            SwapProbability 1.0
            CreateNumberOfMolecules 0

